        },
        {
          "text": "Uhoraho Imana yanyu azotuma muhindukira, muve mu kinyago, abagirire ikigongwe, asubire kubakoraniriza hamwe, abakūye mu mahanga yose ah’ azoba yarabasābagirije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.1.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 1:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi namba har’ abirukanywe bo muri mwebge bazoba bar’ iy’ ijuru riherera, Uhoraho Imana yanyu azobakūrayo, abakoranye, mber’ iyo ni ho azoja kubazana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ Uhoraho Imana yanyu azobasubiza mu gihugu car’ ishamvu ya ba sogokuruza, namwe mucegukire; kand’ azobagirira neza, abagwize gusumvya ba sogokuruza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
